{"completed": true, "response": "```json\n{\n  \"options\": [\n    {\n      \"line\": \"他生出一种踏实的骄傲，觉得自己仍能认真对待珍爱的东西。早先预尝失去的心酸，让他格外在意自己还能为它做些什么。\",\n      \"history\": [\n        \"他开始感到，自己仍能主动回应所珍视之物。\"\n      ],\n      \"credibility\": 7,\n      \"why\": \"这一解释把他的力量感理解为主动承担的信心，能承接前文对失去的担忧，但从珍惜直接推到主动行动仍有一定推断。\",\n      \"uses\": [\"候选8\", \"候选12\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"line\": \"他对珍爱之物生出酸楚的怀念，连眼下的珍惜都带着惆怅；先前预尝过失去的心痛，让他如今在珍惜时也感到失落。\",\n      \"history\": [\n        \"对珍爱之物的预期失去，开始转化为当下的怀念与惆怅。\"\n      ],\n      \"credibility\": 8,\n      \"why\": \"这一解释贴合听感中的私人伤感，并将前文对未来失去的预感推进为当下的情绪体验，不过把这种体验具体理解为怀念仍属推断。\",\n      \"uses\": []\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```", "metadata": {"session_handle": "b073e373-3293-46b7-96b5-71e52e7e40cb", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261023T032954193012Z", "elapsed_seconds": 69.016, "completed_utc": "2026-10-23T03:31:03.217508+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "c1a0950bf8617129c76e55a99690a89d04e81115f924e6610760a92e2a9cec2e", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "30cf31059194d34457cecf86ec06639767021c07b9a7cda0ca767614c0d702ad", "to